      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hathaway_Pines%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Hathaway Pines experiences a warm‑summer Mediterranean climate, with dry summers and average monthly highs never exceeding 71.6°F.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
